<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-081" chapter-id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line" source-id="s-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line-ws11237683">
  <p id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p001:m0000" ref="d9b_790_9f0">寶</persName>二子：<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p001:m0004" ref="d9b_790_9f0_A">穆之</persName>、安之。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p002:m0000" ref="d9b_790_9f0_A">穆之</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p002:m0003" ref="d9b_790_9f0_A">憲祖</persName>，小字<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p002:m0008" ref="d9b_790_9f0_A">武生</persName>，名犯王靖後諱，故行字，後又以<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p002:m0025" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>母名憲，乃更稱小字。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p003:m0000" ref="d9b_790_9f0_A">穆之</persName>與球伐堅，至於巴西郡，以糧運乏少，退屯巴東，病卒。追贈中軍將軍，諡曰烈。子<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p003:m0039" ref="d9b_790_9f0_AA">珍</persName>嗣，位至天門太守。<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p003:m0049" ref="d9b_790_9f0_AA">珍</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p003:m0051" ref="m7n_39i_5bk">璩</persName>、球、璠、<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p003:m0057" ref="d9b_790_9f0_AB">瑾</persName>、瑗，<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p003:m0061" ref="m7n_39i_5bk">璩</persName>最知名。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p004:m0000" ref="m7n_39i_5bk">璩</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p004:m0002" ref="d9b_790_9f0_AB">瑾</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p004:m0004" ref="wow_07g_swu">修之</persName>時為<persName id="c-jinshu-081-maoxiu-paternal-line:p004:m0008" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF">玄</persName>屯騎校尉，</p>
</text>
